{
  "title": "Notes on building in the ope",
  "dateline": "June 2026 · 8 min read",
  "cover": "/media/cover.svg",
  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "There is a special kind of clarity that comes from making the editing surface the same as the reading surface. You stop guessing what the published page will look like, because "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "you are editing the published page",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "italic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "h2",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The document is the truth"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every keystroke is an oation on a constrained document model — never a raw mutation of the DOM, and the whole website. The page you see is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "projection",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of that model, so it can be rendered read-only and, on demand, made editable, without ever disagreeing with itself."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Edit the thing you are reading. The model stays authoritative; the surface just changes posture."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When you are done, the same document round-trips back to its source. Read more on the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "approach",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://example.com/approach"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}